{"1573720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Agatha Christie - Hercule Poirot: The First Cases", "steam_appid": 1573720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [1769070], "detailed_description": "<h1>A new adventure awaits</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573720/extras/8cb139b0d06b3b06e3f55d8980780439.avif?t=1743171933\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Discover the early cases of the legendary detective Hercule Poirot.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573720/extras/d841e40d9f3082864bbef440347f7349.poster.avif?t=1743171933\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573720/extras/d841e40d9f3082864bbef440347f7349.webm?t=1743171933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573720/extras/d841e40d9f3082864bbef440347f7349.mp4?t=1743171933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In his <strong>early years</strong> as a <strong>detective</strong>, Hercule Poirot is invited to a reception by the influential Van den Bosch family, for the announcement of their daughter’s engagement. But tensions amongst the guests run high as a <strong>snowstorm</strong> descends on the town, trapping everyone inside the manor. The happy event is soon marred by the <strong>murder</strong> of one of the guests…<br> <br>In the right place at the right time, Poirot immediately begins to<strong> investigate</strong>. What <strong>buried secrets</strong> and <strong>deadly rivalries</strong> will he uncover?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features: </h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://sha